  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Potato smallholders capacity building project, Punjab</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to improve the production and sustainability of almost 1,000 potato smallholders in four districts of Punjab in Pakistan. This will be done by organising an intensive training and extension programme consisting of a mix of demo&apos;s, seed potato plots, practical farmers&apos; training, field days and extension support.A training of training approach will be used to expand the project from one to four districts and tailor-made potato manual and extension material will be developed for future use. The duration of the project is 2,5 year.</narrative>
  </description>
